    {
      "id": 410190640,
      "title": "Vienna Roast",
      "handle": "vienna-roast",
      "body_html": "<p>The second darkest of our roasts, this blend, with <strong>coffee beans</strong> from Karnataka and Tamil Nadu, has great body, low acidity, and is a favourite choice for coffee drinkers who enjoy a strong cup, with its characteristic bittersweet notes. The Vienna Roast is best enjoyed with milk. </p>\n<p>Best enjoyed with milk, we recommend brewing this as an <strong><a href=\"https://bluetokaicoffee.com/collections/automated-brewing/products/espresso-machine\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">espresso</a> </strong>or using manual brewing equipment such as Moka Pot, French Press, or South Indian filter. </p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Recommended Resting Period:<span> </span></strong><span>9</span><span> Days</span></p>",
      "published_at": "2026-06-18T16:55:24+05:30",
