    {
      "id": 4459725553719,
      "title": "Mixed | Light to Dark Roasts - Easy Pour",
      "handle": "mixed-light-to-dark-roasts",
      "body_html": "<p><span><i>Brewing made easy! Our mixed bag contains a range of single-estate coffees of different roast levels, so you can try them all. Seethargundu Estate is a light roast that offers a clean, crisp body, sweet aromas and a refreshing citrusy aftertaste, while Vienna is a dark roast that’s bitter and bold. Thogarihunkal Estate is a fruity medium roast and Attikan Estate is medium-dark that packs a nutty, chocolatey punch, Jacaranda Blend is a sweet, and chocolatey medium-dark roast.</i></span></p>\n<p><i><span>Choose from our pack of 5 or pack of 10 Easy Pour boxes.</span></i></p>",
