      "title": "Cold Brew Bags - Bold",
      "handle": "cold-brew-bag-bold",
      "body_html": "<h6 class=\"heading\">Chocolatey + Robust</h6>\n<p>Our Cold Brew Bold is a dark roast perfect for those who enjoy a robust kick in their coffee and prefer low acidity. This blend has a nutty flavour profile with notes of dark chocolate and roasted nuts. Perfect for milky drinks. </p>\n<p class=\"boldtext\">Each box contains Cold Brew sachets of 45g each.</p>",
