    {
      "id": 6619685027895,
      "title": "Assorted 6-Pack",
      "handle": "assorted-6-pack",
      "body_html": "<p>Our multi-flavoured 6-pack of cold brew cans is the perfect way to try all our new, delicious cold brews. In this pack, <span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">you’ll find an assortment of our coffee cans</span>, with options for diverse palates:</p>\n<p>1 x Classic Bold - 250mL<br>1 x Classic Light - 250mL<br>1 x Elderflower <meta charset=\"utf-8\">- 250mL<br>1 x Orange Mint <meta charset=\"utf-8\">- 250mL<br>1 x Mocha Cold Coffee <meta charset=\"utf-8\">- 220mL<br>1 x Classic Cold Coffee - 220mL</p>\n<p>All our cold brews use 100% Arabica coffee beans, are sourced directly from India’s best farms and are roasted with precision for a unique flavour.</p>",
